  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Roughly chop tomato. Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bca7429d9f150350002922/step-b633e762.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 the butter with a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the carrot until softened, 2-3 mins. Add 1/2 the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add water and a pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Stir in couscous. Cover and remove from heat. Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bca7429d9f150350002922/step-b5b66082.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, until tender, 4-5 mins. Cook remaining garlic, Persian spice blend and tomato paste until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in coconut milk, vegetable stock powder, chickpeas and a splash of water.\n• Simmer until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins. Stir through remaining butter. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bca7429d9f150350002922/step-7d9c09f9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine tomato, spinach, remaining carrot and a drizzle of red wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Divide carrot couscous, Persian-spiced chickpeas and salad between bowls. Sprinkle with flaked almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bca7429d9f150350002922/step-b80f5fb1.jpg"
    }
  ]
